  "principles": [
    "Water and shoreline items are player-placed; the base map is kept uncluttered.",
    "Separate ice decorations from open-water plants and structures.",
    "Owned items remain saved when hidden for a season, and return when conditions allow.",
    "A species discovered elsewhere remains in the shared field guide; avoid duplicating the discovery merely for the eastern lake.",
    "Freezing does not erase purchases, and summer species do not appear on a fully frozen lake."
